OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FGradually brightening up,
OL,6,Fafter a cloudy and damp start, with
OL,7,Fsunny spells and a scattering of light
OL,8,Fshowers.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,11,Fspells and showers expected throughout
OL,12,Fthis period. Some of the showers will
OL,13,Fbe heavy and times, with the risk of
OL,14,Fhail and thunder. A fresh feel for all.
